{"id":"c05617254d3afc97","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-extension.md","title":"真理扩展","display":"df-truth-extension — 真理扩展","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-extension","aliases":["91-df-truth-extension","91-df-extension"],"display":"df-truth-extension — 真理扩展","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-extension</span><span>91-df-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-extension — 真理扩展"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-extension-—-真理扩展-$\\mathrm{Ext}$\">df-truth-extension — 真理扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span> (真理理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (基础理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (理论语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n\\bigl(S\\vdash\\varphi\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n\\bigl(S\\vdash\\varphi\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span> : 扩展关系（extension relation）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\\)</span>：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> 在基础语言后果上扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理扩展的含义：\n真理理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span>是PA的扩展，当且仅当所有PA可证的句子在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span>中也可证。</p>\n<p>扩展 vs 保守扩张：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>新定理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA} \\vdash \\varphi \\to \\mathcal{T}_T \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{PA} \\vdash \\varphi \\to \\mathcal{T}_T \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td>可有可无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保守扩张</td>\n<td>扩展 + 不增加新算术定理</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>以 PA 为基础理论的标准 TB、UTB、KF、FS 版本都满足上述扩展关系；\n若更换其基础理论或公理化版本，则必须重新标明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>扩展的方向性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扩展关系是单向的：从基础理论到真理理论</li>\n<li>扩展保证基础理论的定理在真理理论中成立</li>\n<li>扩展是真理理论的基本要求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-extension-—-真理扩展-$\\mathrm{Ext}$","text":"df-truth-extension — 真理扩展 $\\mathrm{Ext}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_T$ (真理理论, see [[91-df-truth-theory]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n\\bigl(S\\vdash\\varphi\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA} \\vdash \\varphi \\to \\mathcal{T}_T \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1691,"backlinks":[{"id":"3d4231874a161ab6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-extension]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-extension]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-